Description: FluorineOS artwork, wallpapers, and unified toolkit defaults
 This package installs the visual assets and desktop defaults for FluorineOS,
 including:
 .
 - AMOLED 3840x2160 SVG wallpapers for the OLED Void design language
 - Plymouth boot splash theme using the script plugin
 - fastfetch ASCII logo and JSONC configuration
 - Calamares installer branding, QML slideshow, and stylesheet
 - GTK 3 and GTK 4 dark settings with the AMOLED Void accent palette
 - qt5ct and qt6ct palettes so Qt applications match the desktop
 - dconf defaults for the dark color scheme, icon theme, and cursor size
 - Hyprland idle, scaling, and toolkit environment defaults are provided by
   fluorine-desktop

